==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Emerald|Illumise|32}} from the {{TCG|EX Emerald}} expansion.
*'''Mental Crush''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|SWSH Promo|Hatterene V|55}}, one of the {{TCG|SWSH Black Star Promos}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

